OL,3,APakistan ex-PM Imran Khan back in jail
OL,4,Aafter hospital examination
OL,5,
OL,6,FPakistan's former Prime Minister Imran
OL,7,FKhan was moved back to prison early on
OL,8,FFriday after being examined by doctors
OL,9,Fat a hospital in Islamabad, who deemed
OL,10,Fhim "medically fit".
OL,12,FKhan was seen by "a team of qualified
OL,13,Fdoctors" including an ophthalmologist,
OL,14,Fa cardiologist and a physician,
OL,15,FPakistan's information minister
OL,16,FAttaullah Tarar said.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
