OL,3,APakistan ex-PM Imran Khan back in jail
OL,4,Aafter hospital examination
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Supreme Court had on Tuesday
OL,7,Fordered that the
OL,8,Fcricketer-turned-politician be taken to
OL,9,Fthe hospital within 48 hours to be
OL,10,Fexamined by physicians, following
OL,11,Fcomplaints about his health.
OL,13,FIt was the most significant relief Khan
OL,14,Fhas received from the courts since he
OL,15,Fwas imprisoned in 2023 on corruption
OL,16,Fcharges, which he says were politically
OL,17,Fmotivated.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
